    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "text",
    "contract": "DatabasesBase<TConfiguration>.Database exposes two DataConnection handles, Read and Write, as a read/write connection pair. If configuration supplies only one role's endpoint, both handles use that supplied endpoint; if both endpoints are supplied, each handle uses its corresponding endpoint."
